---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Outdoors & Water" description="Hiking, beaches, water sports, and winter activities around the farm.">
	<p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/activities">Activities</a> › Outdoors &amp; Water</p>

	<div class="page-header">
		<h1>Outdoors &amp; Water</h1>
	</div>

	<div class="prose">
		<h2>Hiking Trails</h2>
		<ul class="entry-list">
			<li><a href="/activities/gettjarnsklatten">Gettjärnsklätten</a><p>A steep cliff with the best view in the valley.</p></li>
			<li><span class="entry-title">"Gruvrundan" i Ängen</span></li>
			<li><span class="entry-title">Tossebergsklätten</span></li>
			<li><span class="entry-title">Kymmenbergs gård</span></li>
			<li><span class="entry-title">Gruvan i Filipstad</span></li>
		</ul>
		<p>
			<a href="https://selmaspa.se/vandringsleder/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Selma Spa's full trail list →</a><br />
			<a href="https://www.svenskaturistforeningen.se/guider-tips/leder/signaturled-varmland/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">More Värmland trails via Svenska Turistföreningen →</a>
		</p>

		<h2>Beaches</h2>
		<ul class="entry-list">
			<li>
				<span class="entry-title">Öjerviks gård</span><span class="entry-meta">2 min walk</span>
				<p>Five private beaches along 2 kilometers of the farm's own coastline on Lake Fryken. Take a short walk and pick whichever suits your day.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<span class="entry-title">Öjervik</span><span class="entry-meta">5 min</span>
				<p>The public beach next to the farm, with fire pits and a beach volleyball court.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<span class="entry-title">Aplungen</span><span class="entry-meta">10 min drive</span>
				<p>A large beach at the south end of Lake Aplungen with grill spots. Shallower and a few degrees warmer than the other lakes.</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<span class="entry-title">Trötvik</span><span class="entry-meta">20 min drive</span>
				<p>A popular local beach at the north end of Lake Rottnen, big enough for a crowd.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>Water Sports at the Farm</h2>
		<ul class="entry-list">
			<li><span class="entry-title">Canoeing</span></li>
			<li><span class="entry-title">Fishing</span><p>Guided trips on the lake can be arranged with Martin, a friend of the family. Ask your host about his availability.</p></li>
			<li><span class="entry-title">Rowing</span></li>
			<li><span class="entry-title">SUPing</span></li>
		</ul>

		<h2>Winter Activities</h2>
		<p><strong>Downhill &amp; cross-country skiing (and snowboarding):</strong> Torsby Skitunnel, SkiSunne, Ängen, Hovfjället, Branäs</p>
		<ul class="entry-list">
			<li><span class="entry-title">Ice skating on frozen lakes</span><p>"Lersjön," near Gettjärnsklätten, is usually best. Proceed with caution.</p></li>
			<li><span class="entry-title">Snowmobile safaris</span></li>
			<li><span class="entry-title">Sledding in Ängen</span></li>
		</ul>
	</div>
</Layout>
